<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνωφελέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in aiding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.5.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					18.2
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ εἴς τι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.14
			</span></i>; rarely <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				871
			</span></i>: abs., <i>to be of use</i> or <i>assist together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				3.583.13
			</span></i> (Olbia, <span class="entity">ii/iii A.D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.2.27
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>derive profit together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.93
			</span></i>.</div>
